-- Scontro a squadre (SPEC §5.19, docs/COMBAT.md), stage 5, batch 13: the kits of 25 more characters
-- that do not come out of the packs, P303 to P327 (8 Delta, 17 Gamma)
-- (src/lib/combat-kits-batch-13.ts on 26 November 2026, described in docs/COMBAT-KITS.md). Each one
-- was simulated on its own card: with its kit, in a random team against a random team, it wins
-- between 46% and 56%.
--
-- A kit an admin already saved from the EDITOR for one of these characters stays as it is.

